<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is officially sanctioning the use of torture on Palestinian prisoners to extract confessions, while the UN warns the Gaza war has undone 77 years of human development and deepening hunger across the Middle East. Netanyahu remains the focal point of American public opinion, and Abbas is poised to label Hamas a terror group, a move that could reshape Palestinian politics. Hamas chief’s son survived an Israeli assassination attempt, and Israel has bombed multiple Hamas weapons depots and killed several Hamas operatives in Gaza. 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/israel-officially-sanctions-torture-palestinian-prisoners-confessions-report&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOUGYzNUhTcUF4SGJUcUE2Q19GTG5VOExRY3JVYWFELUxFVFRfemxEQUVUdkZXVll5VjQxZlQ4a3hBVXJILVBicHEya21URF8ySU9ISHNfakFvZGszQXNBS0UwZU9xajVHWmZJdW5obUJ6ZTllT2E5bFhmUmdPb1hRZ2hhc2swX0tzcXl6bzRUeGdIdUczSFFYci1rTTlPVDNtekN3dm40cXRZSHJ6RXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNMEsyZm84M2xZc2d6N1N5QnF6VTVhM1VHeWVSUWZ3cmFNMHExdFFKZGhydjl0bng4WlpyY0xZa2lsRTJ2d05mV2pYbUFyMk5kQjFscTFONFN6Q0lONkQ4RzZIQ1p6U0U0RmUwNWpFaFZ3OU1MYi1UNUhBa3lmYUpJbzg5TGNHanRvOTZneDdlQTZ2WG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNU1FpWUlFWnplOTY5